'''Cold Aegis''' is a [[skill]] that applies a protective [[buff]] on the character and absorbs [[cold damage]] from [[hit]]s up to a certain amount before it temporarily dissipates.

==Acquisition==
Cold Aegis can only be obtained by equipping {{il|Vix Lunaris}}, having a capacity of 1000.

